sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Service
  participant DB as Ledger + outbox
  participant P as Publisher
  participant Br as Broker
  participant Co as Consumer with inbox
  S->>DB: business change and outbox row in one transaction
  P->>DB: reads pending rows
  P->>Br: publishes TransferCommitted
  P--xDB: crashes before marking it as sent
  P->>Br: republishes the same event
  Br->>Co: delivery 1
  Co->>Co: applies the effect and records opId in the inbox
  Br->>Co: delivery 2
  Co->>Co: opId already seen, discards
